# Files excluded from the Vercel deployment.
#
# Probably Weather is a zero-build static deploy: each deploy uploads the repo
# minus the patterns below, and whatever is uploaded is what the site serves at
# its root. Before this file existed, internal docs were publicly fetchable
# (audit 2026-05-31, FIX 1: /CLAUDE.md, /AUDIT_REPORT.md,
# /PROBABLY_WEATHER_MONETISATION_INFRA_REPORT.md, /lighthouse-report.json all
# returned 200 on prod). These are info-disclosure, not secrets (no tokens are
# committed; keys live in env vars).
#
# SAFE-TO-EXCLUDE check: the running site serves only HTML pages
# (index.html, install.html, privacy.html), assets/**, api/**, og/**,
# manifest.json, sw.js, vercel.json, and .well-known/** — NONE of which is a
# .md file, so excluding all markdown cannot drop a user-facing page. The only
# in-repo .md reference is a code comment (app.js → docs/picker-rotation-logic.md),
# not a runtime fetch.

# Internal planning / audit / review / ship-notes docs — all markdown, none served.
*.md
docs/

# Lighthouse report artifact.
lighthouse-report.json

# Stray MyChannel screenshots accidentally dropped into this repo.
mc-*.png

# Internal tooling / config — committed but never runtime-served (verified: no
# api/** or assets/** import or fetch references tools/ or scripts/). The OG
# generator under tools/ is run locally; its output (og/*.jpg) is committed
# separately and served from og/.
tools/
scripts/
.claude/
.github/
